ttp://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="2.779ex" height="2.317ex" viewBox="0 -896.2 1196.4 997.6" role="img" focusable="false" style="vertical-align: -0.235ex;"><g stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g is="true"><g is="true"><g is="true"><use xlink:href="#MJMATHI-4B"></use></g></g><g is="true" transform="translate(901,410)"><g is="true"><use transform="scale(0.707)" xlink:href="#MJMAIN-2032"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></span></span> and <span class="math"><span class="MathJax_Preview" style=""></span><span class="MathJax_SVG" id="MathJax-Element-39-Frame" tabindex="0" style="font-size: 90%; display: inline-block;"><svg xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="2.602ex" height="2.317ex" viewBox="0 -896.2 1120.2 997.6" role="img" focusable="false" style="vertical-align: -0.235ex;"><g stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g is="true"><g is="true"><g is="true"><use xlink:href="#MJMATHI-56"></use></g></g><g is="true" transform="translate(825,410)"><g is="true"><use transform="scale(0.707)" xlink:href="#MJMAIN-2032"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></span></span> are the reduced-dimensional keys and values, and <span class="math"><span class="MathJax_Preview" style=""></span><span class="MathJax_SVG" id="MathJax-Element-40-Frame" tabindex="0" style="font-size: 90%; display: inline-block;"><svg xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="2.581ex" height="2.317ex" viewBox="0 -747.2 1111.3 997.6" role="img" focusable="false" style="vertical-align: -0.582ex;"><g stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g is="true"><g is="true"><g is="true"><use xlink:href="#MJMATHI-50"></use></g></g><g is="true" transform="translate(642,-150)"><g is="true"><use transform="scale(0.707)" xlink:href="#MJMATHI-6B"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></span></span> and <span class="math"><span class="MathJax_Preview" style=""></span><span